rm Video, Influencer Marketing. Good communication skills required.\",\"perks\":\"Medical Insurance, Paid Leaves, Flexible Hours, Learning Budget, Team Outings\"}','{\"openings\":1,\"hiring_urgency\":\"Immediately\",\"walk_in\":false}','{\"apply_mode\":\"Online\",\"contact_email\":\"recruit@creativestudiohub.in\"}','{\"city\":\"Mumbai\",\"country\":\"India\"}',0,NULL),('0166dc87-0e0e-4e67-b04c-1c1118753b41','Wind Energy Technician','Perform preventive and corrective maintenance on 2 MW and 3 MW wind turbines. Monitor performance via SCADA, troubleshoot faults, and ensure maximum turbine availability.','Permanent','5-9 LPA','On-site','2-5 Years',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Wind Turbine Maintenance\",\"SCADA\",\"Electrical Safety\",\"Hydraulics\",\"Gearbox Maintenance\"]','OPEN','Jaisalmer','2026-07-29 10:31:18','2026-07-29 10:31:18','ec8e1562-e874-4905-a443-decf738a7fec','704c2bdf-dd77-4b77-9032-388e4149cdfe','Operations','Wind Energy','Full Time','{\"min\":\"5\",\"max\":\"9\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"display\":\"5-9 LPA\"}','{\"min\":\"2\",\"max\":\"5\",\"display\":\"2-5 Years\"}',NULL,'{\"responsibilities\":\"Perform preventive and corrective maintenance on 2 MW and 3 MW wind turbines. Monitor performance via SCADA, troubleshoot faults, and ensure maximum turbine availability.\",\"preferred_profile\":\"Candidate should have strong knowledge of Wind Turbine Maintenance, SCADA, Electrical Safety, Hydraulics, Gearbox Maintenance. Good communication skills required.\",\"perks\":\"Medical Insurance, Paid Leaves, Flexible Hours, Learning Budget, Team Outings\"}','{\"openings\":3,\"hiring_urgency\":\"Immediately\",\"walk_in\":false}','{\"apply_mode\":\"Online\",\"contact_email\":\"talent@greenenergycorpindia.com\"}','{\"city\":\"Jaisalmer\",\"country\":\"India\"}',0,NULL),('02c708ec-23aa-4d36-a4c3-264624ee9228','RPF Sub-Inspector (Executive) & Constable Recruitment CEN 01/2026','Official Recruitment for RPF Sub-Inspector (Executive) & Constable Recruitment CEN 01/2026. Vacancies: 4660. Qualification: Graduate from a recognized University for Sub-Inspector; 10th pass (Matriculation) from a recognized Board for Constable..','Full-time','Sub-Inspector: Level 6 of 7th CPC Pay Matrix, Initial Pay Rs. 35,400/- per month. Constable: Level 3 of 7th CPC Pay Matrix, Initial Pay Rs. 21,700/- per month.','On-site',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'OPEN',NULL,'2026-09-05 07:24:46','2026-09-05 07:24:46',NULL,NULL,'Railway Protection Force','Government',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL),('03186d2f-b728-4d4f-a7db-4fd5ad123e15','Solar Project Engineer','Design and execute utility-scale solar PV projects from 10 MW to 200 MW. Prepare SLDs, equipment layouts, and oversee installation of panels, inverters, and grid connectivity.','Permanent','7-13 LPA','On-site','3-6 Years',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Solar PV\",\"AutoCAD Electrical\",\"PVsyst\",\"String Inverters\",\"DC\\/AC Systems\"]','OPEN','Jodhpur','2026-07-29 10:31:18','2026-07-29 10:31:18','ec8e1562-e874-4905-a443-decf738a7fec','704c2bdf-dd77-4b77-9032-388e4149cdfe','Engineering','Renewable Energy','Full Time','{\"min\":\"7\",\"max\":\"13\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"display\":\"7-13 LPA\"}','{\"min\":\"3\",\"max\":\"6\",\"display\":\"3-6 Years\"}',NULL,'{\"responsibilities\":\"Design and execute utility-scale solar PV projects from 10 MW to 200 MW. Prepare SLDs, equipment layouts, and oversee installation of panels, inverters, and grid connectivity.\",\"preferred_profile\":\"Candidate should have strong knowledge of Solar PV, AutoCAD Electrical, PVsyst, String Inverters, DC\\/AC Systems. Good communication skills required.\",\"perks\":\"Medical Insurance, Paid Leaves, Flexible Hours, Learning Budget, Team Outings\"}','{\"openings\":2,\"hiring_urgency\":\"Immediately\",\"walk_in\":false}','{\"apply_mode\":\"Online\",\"contact_email\":\"talent@greenenergycorpindia.com\"}','{\"city\":\"Jodhpur\",\"country\":\"India\"}',0,NULL),('0431cc32-6f62-47b9-968f-4d8ac96c4f7a','[RRB] Junior Engineer (JE) (Batch 06DQ)','Recru